{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-129140" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}[3f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-1,\\,-2,\\,1⟩$\nand \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,4,\\,-1⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{4}[3f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=3{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{4}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}[3f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =3{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{4}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =3⟨-1,\\,-2,\\,1⟩-⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,4,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,\\,-6,\\,3⟩-⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,4,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-10,\\,4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-10,\\,4⟩"] ["math" "⟨2+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-6,\\,1⟩"] ["math" "⟨2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-8,\\,6⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-5,\\,2⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-1,\\,2,\\,-2⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129140" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,-10,\\,4⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98170" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${\\int }_{1}^{3}[f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}-1,\\,2⟩$ and ${\\int }_{1}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\frac{3}{4},\\,\\frac{1}{2},\\,-\\frac{5}{2}⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98170" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{3}[f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{1}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}[f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{1}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}-1,\\,2⟩+4⟨\\frac{3}{4},\\,\\frac{1}{2},\\,-\\frac{5}{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}-1,\\,2⟩+⟨3,\\,2,\\,-10⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}+1,\\,-8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98170" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-98170" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98170" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-8+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,1,\\,0⟩"] ["math" "⟨3+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}+1,\\,-8⟩"] ["math" "⟨3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}-3,\\,8⟩"] ["math" "⟨8+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}+1,\\,-12⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3},\\,1⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98170" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨3+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3,\\,\\sqrt{3}+1,\\,-8⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${\\int }_{-1}^{1}[f(t)-\\frac{3}{2}g(t)]\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{-1}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,6,\\,-1⟩$ and ${\\int }_{-1}^{1}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{1}[f(t)-\\frac{3}{2}g(t)]\\text{d}t={\\int }_{-1}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-\\frac{3}{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}[f(t)-\\frac{3}{2}g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-\\frac{3}{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,6,\\,-1⟩-\\frac{3}{2}⟨1,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,6,\\,-1⟩-⟨\\frac{3}{2}\\,-3,\\,-9⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,9,\\,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-129143" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129143" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-1,\\,9,\\,8⟩"] ["math" "⟨-2,\\,3,\\,9⟩"] ["math" "⟨-\\frac{1}{2},\\,3,\\,5⟩"] ["math" "⟨-\\frac{3}{2},\\,5,\\,2⟩"] ["math" "⟨2,\\,-4,\\,6⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129143" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-1,\\,9,\\,8⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98158" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}[\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-6,\\,-2,\\,8⟩$\nand \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨4,\\,3,\\,-1⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98158" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}[\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}[\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}⟨-6,\\,-2,\\,8⟩-⟨4,\\,3,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,\\,-1,\\,4⟩-⟨4,\\,3,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-7,\\,-4,\\,5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98158" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-98158" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98158" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-4,\\,-3,\\,3⟩"] ["math" "⟨-7,\\,-4,\\,5⟩"] ["math" "⟨-7,\\,2,\\,5⟩"] ["math" "⟨1,\\,-1,\\,-3⟩"] ["math" "⟨1,\\,-4,\\,3⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98158" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-7,\\,-4,\\,5⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98157" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{2}[2f(t)+3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨{e}^{2}-1,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,3⟩$ and ${\\int }_{0}^{2}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨3,\\,-1,\\,5⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98157" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}[2f(t)+3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=2{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+3{\\int }_{0}^{2}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[2f(t)+3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =2{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+3{\\int }_{0}^{2}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2⟨{e}^{2}-1,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,3⟩+3⟨3,\\,-1,\\,5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{2}-2,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,6⟩+⟨9,\\,-3,\\,15⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{2}+7,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98157" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-98157" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98157" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨2{e}^{2}+7,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩"] ["math" "⟨2{e}^{2},\\,6\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,21⟩"] ["math" "⟨2{e}^{2}-7,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡2+3,\\,9⟩"] ["math" "⟨4{e}^{2}+3,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2+9,\\,12⟩"] ["math" "⟨7{e}^{2},\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98157" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨2{e}^{2}+7,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98189" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨2,\\,-4,\\,6⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98189" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨2,\\,-4,\\,6⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,4,\\,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot ⟨-2,\\,4,\\,-6⟩-{⟨3t,\\,-t,\\,-2t⟩|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2,\\,-3⟩-⟨6,\\,-2,\\,-4⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨-7,\\,4,\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98189" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-98189" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98189" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-6,\\,3,\\,2⟩"] ["math" "⟨-7,\\,0,\\,1⟩"] ["math" "⟨-7,\\,4,\\,1⟩"] ["math" "⟨5,\\,0,\\,-1⟩"] ["math" "⟨5,\\,4,\\,-1⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98189" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-7,\\,4,\\,1⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98184" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{3}^{0}\\frac{2}{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int 