ile" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-129180" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129180" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-3,\\,5,\\,-8⟩"] ["math" "⟨1,\\,-8,\\,6⟩"] ["math" "⟨2,\\,-5,\\,-4⟩"] ["math" "⟨3,\\,-6,\\,-1⟩"] ["math" "⟨3,\\,-8,\\,1⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129180" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨3,\\,-6,\\,-1⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129266" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)+⟨1,\\,-1,\\,0⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-1,\\,3,\\,-2⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129266" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-1,\\,3,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)+⟨1,\\,-1,\\,0⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{1}^{0}⟨1,\\,-1,\\,0⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩+⟨t,\\,-t,\\,0⟩{|}_{1}^{0} \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩+⟨-1,\\,1,\\,0⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,-2,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129266" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-129266" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129266" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-2,\\,4,\\,2⟩"] ["math" "⟨0,\\,-1,\\,1⟩"] ["math" "⟨0,\\,-2,\\,2⟩"] ["math" "⟨0,\\,-4,\\,3⟩"] ["math" "⟨1,\\,-2,\\,4⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129266" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨0,\\,-2,\\,2⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98185" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)+⟨2,\\,1,\\,3⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-4,\\,-5,\\,1⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98185" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-4,\\,-5,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,5,\\,-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)+⟨2,\\,1,\\,3⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨2,\\,1,\\,3⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,5,\\,-1⟩+{⟨2t,\\,t,\\,3t⟩|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,5,\\,-1⟩+⟨4,\\,2,\\,6⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨8,\\,7,\\,5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98185" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-98185" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98185" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨0,\\,-3,\\,5⟩"] ["math" "⟨10,\\,7,\\,6⟩"] ["math" "⟨10,\\,7,\\,7⟩"] ["math" "⟨7,\\,8,\\,-5⟩"] ["math" "⟨8,\\,7,\\,5⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98185" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨8,\\,7,\\,5⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98267" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-8⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,0,\\,-2⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98267" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-8⟩-⟨-3,\\,0,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨7,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98267" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-98267" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98267" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-7,\\,2,\\,-3⟩"] ["math" "⟨1,\\,-1,\\,-6⟩"] ["math" "⟨11,\\,-2,\\,-3⟩"] ["math" "⟨7,\\,-1,\\,-10⟩"] ["math" "⟨7,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-98267" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨7,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨5,\\,1,\\,20⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,1,\\,8⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{4}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨5,\\,1,\\,20⟩-⟨1,\\,1,\\,8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,0,\\,12⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b7121365a5651064a63e6ad7ea3d7b613dcf9341122c72f075f95529beee1ea"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057355/state.json" "file_sha256" "f7c40295f4baed3c0cd6dc3d16d77866bf19804d9350263fccba5f104ae8390c"} {"question" "q-129270" "field" "sele